    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE BIOGRAPHICAL DIRECTORY OF THE RAILWAY OFFICIALS OF AMERICA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BOOK"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Biographical Directory of the Railway Officials of America is a book cited as a reference for George Frank Butler's attendance at Rush Medical College, though the accuracy is uncertain."</data>
